flowchart TB
  USER[Researcher provides project path and objective]
  GUARD[Consent + read-only boundary\npath validation • exclusions • checksum policy]
  SCAN[Project Discovery\nfiles • folders • metadata • code • notebooks • logs]
  CLASS[Domain and workflow classification\nDFT/materials • AI/ML • quantum • other]
  MAP[Project Knowledge Map\nmethods • datasets • runs • results • figures • tables • references]
  RECON[Workflow Reconstruction\nwhat was attempted • what actually ran • dependencies]
  AUDIT[Research Audit]
  NOV[Novelty / Impact Audit\nliterature gap • contribution candidates • journal scope]
  EVI[Evidence Sufficiency Audit\nclaims • controls • baselines • uncertainty • figures/tables]
  METH[Methodology Audit\nparameters • convergence • validation • reproducibility]
  CONS[Consistency Audit\ncode • outputs • plots • text • units • numbers]
  REP[Readiness Report\nREADY • DRAFTABLE WITH WARNINGS • NEEDS WORK • INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE]
  HUMAN[Human review of assessment]
  PLAN[Manuscript plan\nclaims • outline • journal profile • missing-evidence tasks]
  COMPLETE[Research completion plan\nadditional runs • experiments • analyses • documentation]
  WRITE[Controlled manuscript pipeline]
  QA[Scientific QA + publication QA]
  RELEASE[Human-approved release package]

  USER --> GUARD --> SCAN --> CLASS --> MAP --> RECON --> AUDIT
  AUDIT --> NOV
  AUDIT --> EVI
  AUDIT --> METH
  AUDIT --> CONS
  NOV --> REP
  EVI --> REP
  METH --> REP
  CONS --> REP
  REP --> HUMAN
  HUMAN -->|Approved and sufficient| PLAN --> WRITE --> QA --> RELEASE
  HUMAN -->|Promising but incomplete| COMPLETE --> MAP
  HUMAN -->|Insufficient evidence| COMPLETE
  HUMAN -->|Reject / re-scan| SCAN

  classDef gate fill:#fff7e6,stroke:#b7791f
  classDef audit fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#2b6cb0
  classDef store fill:#f0fff4,stroke:#2f855a
  class GUARD,HUMAN gate
  class NOV,EVI,METH,CONS audit
  class MAP,REP,RELEASE store
